---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoContextCancelDemo from '../demos/GoContextCancelDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gccd-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: r.Context() premature abort, WithoutCancel, and RWMutex deadlock" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: Hủy sớm r.Context(), context.WithoutCancel và deadlock RWMutex">
    <GoContextCancelDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Switch through why spawning async background work with HTTP r.Context() aborts immediately after response writes, how context.WithoutCancel preserves values safely, and why recursive RLock deadlocks under writer contention.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm xem vì sao đưa r.Context() vào goroutine chạy nền làm job hủy ngay lúc HTTP vừa trả response, cách dùng context.WithoutCancel giữ trace ID và chuỗi khóa chết khi gọi RLock lồng RLock.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gccd-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gccd-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gccd-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gccd .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gccd .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gccd .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gccd .sd-stat b { font-size: 15px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gccd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gccd-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gccd-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gccd-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gccd-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gccd-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gccd-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 22px; }
  .gccd-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gccd-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gccd-note p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  .gccd-state {
    padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
